{"unit":11,"items":30,"pass":21,"title":"Unit Test · Unit 11","html":"\n  <section class=\"stage on\" data-stage=\"Unit Test\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Unit 11 &middot; Unit Test</div>\n      <h2>Making the world better</h2>\n      <p data-t=\"gx251\">Thirty questions on Unit 11 only. Answer them all, then press Check. You need <b>21 out of 30</b> to pass &mdash; and you can take this test as many times as you like.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"review-u11\">\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\" data-t=\"u11r101\">Part 1 &middot; Grammar &nbsp;<span class=\"qcount\">questions 1&ndash;14</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u11r102\">Choose the correct form.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">If I &hellip; the world, I would start with education.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">ran</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">run</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">neither of these</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">If I were you, I &hellip; take the job.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">would</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">will</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">neither of these</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">What &hellip; you do if you won the money?\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">would</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">will</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">neither of these</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">4</span><span class=\"body\">People &hellip; read a weekly paper, not a daily one.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">used to</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">use to</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">was used to</button></div></span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u11r103\">Put the verb in brackets into the correct form.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">5</span><span class=\"body\">(<i>have</i>) If I <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"had\" data-why=\"Second conditional: <i>if</i> + Past Simple &mdash; <b>had</b>.\"> more time, I would learn Arabic.</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">6</span><span class=\"body\">(<i>not be</i>) He <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"didn't use to be|did not use to be|didn&rsquo;t use to be|didnt use to be\" data-why=\"Negative of <i>used to</i>: <b>didn&rsquo;t use to be</b> &mdash; no <i>-d</i> after <i>did</i>.\"> interested in the news.</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">7</span><span class=\"body\">(<i>live</i>) They <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"used to live\" data-why=\"A past situation that is no longer true: <b>used to live</b>.\"> in a village before they moved here.</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u11r104\">Choose the correct form.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">8</span><span class=\"body\">Did you &hellip; walk to school?\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">use to</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">used to</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">was used to</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">9</span><span class=\"body\">If everyone recycled, we &hellip; far less rubbish.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">would produce</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">will produce</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">neither of these</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">10</span><span class=\"body\">There &hellip; be a cinema on this corner.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">used to</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">use to</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">was used to</button></div></span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u11r105\">Each sentence has one wrong word. Click it.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">11</span><span class=\"body\"><span class=\"errline\" data-err=\"3\" data-why=\"After <b>if</b> in the second conditional we use the Past Simple: <i>If I had money&hellip;</i>\"><span class=\"ew\">If</span> <span class=\"ew\">I</span> <span class=\"ew\">would</span> <span class=\"ew\">have</span> <span class=\"ew\">money</span> <span class=\"ew\">I</span> <span class=\"ew\">would</span> <span class=\"ew\">travel</span></span></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">12</span><span class=\"body\"><span class=\"errline\" data-err=\"3\" data-why=\"After <b>did</b> the form is plain: <i>I didn&rsquo;t use to like coffee</i>.\"><span class=\"ew\">I</span> <span class=\"ew\">didn&rsquo;t</span> <span class=\"ew\">used</span> <span class=\"ew\">to</span> <span class=\"ew\">like</span> <span class=\"ew\">coffee</span></span></span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u11r106\">Write the sentence again so that it means the same.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">13</span><span class=\"body\">I don&rsquo;t have a car, so I don&rsquo;t drive to work.<br>If I <input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"had a car|had a car,\" data-why=\"Imaginary present situation: <b>had a car</b>.\"> , I would drive to work.</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">14</span><span class=\"body\">I played football every day as a child, but I don&rsquo;t now.<br>I <input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"used to play football every day|used to play football\" data-why=\"A past habit that stopped: <b>used to play football</b>.\"> .</span></div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\" data-t=\"u11r107\" style=\"margin-top:26px\">Part 2 &middot; Vocabulary &nbsp;<span class=\"qcount\">questions 15&ndash;24</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u11r108\">Complete each sentence with one word.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">15</span><span class=\"body\"><input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"Global|global\" data-why=\"<b>Global warming</b> = the slow rise in the temperature of the earth.\"> warming is changing the weather everywhere.</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">16</span><span class=\"body\">A flood or a hurricane is a natural <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"disaster\" data-why=\"A <b>natural disaster</b> is a sudden natural event that causes great damage.\">.</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">17</span><span class=\"body\">The trees burned for a week. It was a huge forest <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"fire\" data-why=\"A <b>forest fire</b> burns across an area of trees.\">.</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">18</span><span class=\"body\">People vote for a new government in an <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"election\" data-why=\"An <b>election</b> is an occasion when people vote to choose a government.\">.</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">19</span><span class=\"body\">The workers refused to work. They went on <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"strike\" data-why=\"Go on <b>strike</b> = refuse to work in order to demand better conditions.\">.</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u11r109\">Choose the correct phrasal verb.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">20</span><span class=\"body\">She &hellip; up in a small village near Shymkent.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">grew</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">set</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">carried</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">21</span><span class=\"body\">They &hellip; up the company two years ago.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">set</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">found</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">carried</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">22</span><span class=\"body\">The volcano could &hellip; at any time.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">erupt</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">crash</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">spread</button></div></span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u11r110\">One word in each group does not belong. Click it.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">23</span><span class=\"body\"><span class=\"errline\" data-err=\"4\" data-why=\"The others are events in the news. An <b>article</b> is the piece of writing about them.\"><span class=\"ew\">flood</span> <span class=\"ew\">hurricane</span> <span class=\"ew\">forest fire</span> <span class=\"ew\">article</span></span></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">24</span><span class=\"body\"><span class=\"errline\" data-err=\"4\" data-why=\"The others are phrasal verbs. A <b>robbery</b> is a crime.\"><span class=\"ew\">find out</span> <span class=\"ew\">grow up</span> <span class=\"ew\">carry on</span> <span class=\"ew\">robbery</span></span></span></div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\" data-t=\"u11r111\" style=\"margin-top:26px\">Part 3 &middot; Function &nbsp;<span class=\"qcount\">questions 25&ndash;30</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u11r112\">Choose the correct phrase.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">25</span><span class=\"body\">&hellip; my opinion, the museum is worth the money.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">In</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">On</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">At</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">26</span><span class=\"body\">You disagree with somebody, but politely. You say&hellip;\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">&ldquo;You&rsquo;re wrong.&rdquo;</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">&ldquo;I see your point, but I&rsquo;m not so sure.&rdquo;</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">&ldquo;That&rsquo;s a stupid idea.&rdquo;</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">27</span><span class=\"body\">&hellip; , thank you for listening. Any questions?\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">To sum up</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">Firstly</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">In addition</button></div></span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u11r113\">Complete with one word.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">28</span><span class=\"body\">I completely <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"agree\" data-why=\"<b>I completely agree</b> &mdash; the strongest way to say you think the same.\"> with you about that.</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">29</span><span class=\"body\"><input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"Firstly|firstly|First|first\" data-why=\"<b>Firstly</b> &mdash; the standard opener for the first point of a presentation.\">, I&rsquo;d like to tell you how the park was built.</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u11r114\">Put the three parts of the presentation in the usual order.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">30</span><span class=\"body\">\n        <div class=\"order\" data-order=\"r1,r2,r3\">\n          <button class=\"ochip\" data-val=\"r3\"><span class=\"pin\"></span><span class=\"txt\">To sum up, it is worth the trip. Thanks for listening.</span></button>\n          <button class=\"ochip\" data-val=\"r1\"><span class=\"pin\"></span><span class=\"txt\">Good morning. Today I&rsquo;d like to tell you about an underwater museum.</span></button>\n          <button class=\"ochip\" data-val=\"r2\"><span class=\"pin\"></span><span class=\"txt\">Firstly, let me explain how it was built.</span></button>\n        </div>\n      </span></div>\n\n      <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"checkReview(this)\" style=\"margin-top:24px\">Check my answers</button>\n      <div class=\"res\"></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div id=\"reviewResult\" class=\"review-result\"></div>\n  </section>\n"}